{"assertionId":"76465013-a4cf-469a-a616-c8bfadcebcb9","entityBindings":[],"fragments":[{"exactText":"The SystemAge™ Test analyzes 460 epigenetic biomarkers mapped across 21 body systems, selected not just for scale, but for biological relevance. Each biomarker was chosen to reflect meaningful changes in how aging unfolds across systems.","fragmentId":"sha256:4b302c00160c8ebe9e650ad8a0bce4ebb10ea3466078d84614dd2cbb2f5b6115"}],"proposition":"The SystemAge™ Test analyzes 460 epigenetic biomarkers mapped across 21 body systems, selected not just for scale, but for biological relevance. Each biomarker was chosen to reflect meaningful changes in how aging unfolds across systems.","qualifiers":[],"rubricVersion":"evidence-only.v1"}